{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before the End of Andrean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features Act 1 of the full game, featuring full bullet-time combat, stylish gunplay, and two intense boss fights. Step into the decaying world of Andrean, master the flow of time, and uncover the first secrets of a story that is only just beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Hell + Bullet Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn\u2019t a luxury\u2014it\u2019s survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>dynamic conversations</strong> where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean\u2019s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool 2.5D World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted 2.5D world of Overdawn from Wasteland to the slum of Andrean. Full real-time cutscenes break seamlessly between 2D and 3D perspectives, creating a dynamic and immersive narrative experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988240?t=1760294282","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988240?t=1760294282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988240/1eb04fd923b8b26572ef404f4117bcece166d01c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760294282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988240/1eb04fd923b8b26572ef404f4117bcece166d01c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760294282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before the End of Andrean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo features Act 1 of the full game, featuring full bullet-time combat, stylish gunplay, and two intense boss fights. Step into the decaying world of Andrean, master the flow of time, and uncover the first secrets of a story that is only just beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bullet Hell + Bullet Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through storms of enemy fire while slowing time to land the perfect headshot. Precision isn\u2019t a luxury\u2014it\u2019s survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Dialogues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>dynamic conversations</strong> where every word matters. Dialogue shapes your path as you uncover the truth behind Andrean\u2019s downfall. Text comes to life with emotion as you connect with allies, confront enemies, and push forward to the very end.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool 2.5D World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted 2.5D world of Overdawn from Wasteland to the slum of Andrean. Full real-time cutscenes break seamlessly between 2D and 3D perspectives, creating a dynamic and immersive narrative experience.</p>","developers":["Youngje Park"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3519070","name":"Overdawn"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988240/3b2e8ea4ebc832e7b4328afdddc4e22cb32ed274/header.jpg?t=1760294282","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available spa